<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Notwithstanding section 7 of the principal Act, the monthly salaries specified in the amendments to the principal Act in section 4, and payable, shall commence from 1 January 2007 or from the date of appointment or election, whichever is the later, of the President or Deputy President of the Senate and the Speaker or Deputy Speakers of the House of Representatives, as the case may be."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/40/eng@> .
